# Display welcome message for installer mode

# Colors
BLUE='\033[0;34m'
GREEN='\033[0;32m'
YELLOW='\033[1;33m'
NC='\033[0m'

# Create welcome file for login banner
cat > /etc/motd << 'EOF'
================================================================================
            ___  ____  
     _ __  / _ \/ ___| 
    | '_ \| | | \___ \ 
    | | | | |_| |___) |
    |_| |_|\___/|____/ 
                       
                                                  
                    INSTALLATION MODE

Welcome to nOS Installation Environment!

To install nOS to your hard drive:

1. Login with:
   Username: user
   Password: live

2. Run the installer:
   $ sudo nos-installer

3. Follow the installation wizard

The installer will:
- Partition your disk (EFI + Btrfs)
- Install the base system
- Configure bootloader
- Set up nOS services

Need help? Visit: https://github.com/Nithron/nOS/blob/main/docs/installer.md
